        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: One Dance, Do You Mind\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla\n- Albums: Views\n- Roles: rapper, record producer, disk jockey, singer\n\nFacts:\n- DJ Maphorisa, whose real name is Themba Sekowe, was born in 1988.\n- DJ Maphorisa is a South African record producer and disk jockey who sometimes features vocals in songs.\n- Drake is a Canadian rapper.\n- \"One Dance\" is a song by Drake from his fourth studio album, \"Views,\" released in 2016.\n- Kyla is a British singer best known for her song \"Do You Mind.\"\n- \"Do You Mind\" became one of the most successful charting UK funky songs.\n- Kyla's song \"Do You Mind\" was later featured on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance.\"",
